SystemRequirements: APSIM Next Generation (>= 2024.1) and the .NET 8.0 Runtime,
    for the bundled 'Models' and 'apsim-server' executables. The package builds,
    installs and checks without them; entry points that need the simulator
    abstain when it is absent.
